Scope of this licence

The MIT licence covers the source code, configuration files, scripts and
derived summary tables in this repository. It does not cover any dataset: no
images, masks or labels are redistributed here, and each public dataset keeps
its own licence and terms of use (see exp/data/DATASETS.md and
exp/data/EXTERNAL_DATASETS.md).

exp/src/baselines/evapore/ is an adapter that imports the upstream EVAPORE code
(https://github.com/oscarmorand/EVAPORE, GPL-3.0) at run time. The upstream code
is not included in this repository; a program that links it is subject to the
GPL-3.0.
